  "solution": "Concept Used:\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n[8×5-3 of (2(3)/(5)÷1(2)/(5)×5-3)]×(7)/(2)\n\n⇒[8 × 5 – 3 of (13/5 ÷ 7/5 × 5 – 3)] × 7/2\n\n⇒ [8 × 5 – 3 of (13/5 × 5/7 × 5 – 3)] × 7/2\n\n⇒ [8 × 5 – 3 of (13/7 × 5 – 3)] × 7/2\n\n⇒ [8 × 5 – 3 of (65/7 – 3)] × 7/2\n\n⇒ [8 × 5 – 3 of ({65 – 21}/7)] × 7/2\n\n⇒ [8 × 5 – 3 of (44/7)] × 7/2\n\n⇒ [8 × 5 – 3 × 44/7] × 7/2\n\n⇒ (40 – 132/7) × 7/2\n\n⇒ [(280 – 132)/7] × 7/2\n\n⇒ (148/7 × 7/2)\n\n⇒ 74\n\n**∴ The required value is 74**\n\n10",
